Logs possible lag-switch incidents to the server RPT. Clients send heartbeats. If a player's connection goes quiet and a kill arrives around the time they reconnect, the server can record the kill for review. When many clients fall silent together, the server suppresses new flags for that interval. The check tracks the connection through respawn and slot changes. Review the log alongside other evidence before treating an incident as cheating.

